From 0dcb2ba32b2c156f0c3ee71b235484efe3c22ef9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ren=C3=A9=20Dudfield?= <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 12:38:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] app: developmentPlugins: Require explicit user
 confirmation

Require a native Electron confirmation before packaged users can load local development plugins. Renderer UI alone is not a sufficient trust boundary: development plugins execute local code and may request command capabilities, so enabling them requires an explicit app-owned choice that defaults to denial and fails closed.
